    exact HB4.
  - exists (10 * j + 27), (cden [] [] j B1_1RB0LA_1LC0RD_0LA1LD_0RB1RA).
    split; [| exact (geo_1RB0LA_1LC0RD_0LA1LD_0RB1RA p j E)].
