    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StC, S0)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB0LA_1LC0RD_0LA1LD_0RB1RA [SCycL 3 0; SWin 2; SWinL 2] (StC, S0) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
